{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102002","id":2297837926,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6I9jlm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102002","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102002.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102002.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102002","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102002/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102002/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102002/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/45c9fe0d3af32805ee76840848c1f36852bff70b","number":102002,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Allow calling an Object's method on a specific CallQueue","user":{"login":"kisg","id":406832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjgzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg","html_url":"https://github.com/kisg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR adds a new ``call_deferred_on_queue()`` method to the Object type.\r\n\r\nThis is required because call_deferred() semantics has changed: it is now possible to instantiate a CallQueue on a thread, and in this case, call_deferred() will schedule the call on the CallQueue associated with the current thread, instead of the CallQueue on the main thread.\r\n\r\nIn particular the ResourceLoader's thread instantiates a CallQueue, so call_deferred() calls on that thread are scheduled on that thread local CallQueue instance.\r\n\r\nThis new behavior interferes with the usage of ``EditorToaster::popup_str()`` which needs to be deferred on the main thread, because it modifies the scene tree. This PR also modifies popup_str to always defer to the main queue so it can modify the scene tree.\r\n\r\nWithout this change the popup_str() calls on the ResourceLoader thread result in error, like it is currently used in the ResourceImporterTexture class.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by [Migeran](https://migeran.com/).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":